{"seq":2,"slug":"tone-mapping-style","title":"色调映射与风格化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/tone-mapping-style","wordCount":1768,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"色调映射与风格化技术\">色调映射与风格化技术</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>色调映射是塑造画面明暗与色彩分布的核心手段，其要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>双重含义</strong>：技术上指把场景亮度范围压缩到显示可再现范围，创意上指通过非线性曲线塑造明暗基调与色彩倾向。</li>\n<li><strong>全局 vs 局部</strong>：全局映射对所有像素施加统一函数，简单高效但可能丢失局部对比；局部映射基于邻域自适应，保留局部对比却可能产生光晕。</li>\n<li><strong>经典算子</strong>：Reinhard 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{out} = L_{in}/(1+L_{in})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 实现优雅的渐进压缩，ACES RRT/S 曲线则模拟胶片的肩部与趾部滚降。</li>\n<li><strong>风格化手段</strong>：Split Toning 给暗部与亮部分别着色，色彩和声理论（互补、类似、三角色）为色彩搭配提供依据。</li>\n<li><strong>电影质感</strong>：胶片颗粒、Bloom、Halation 等效果为画面增添有机纹理，减少&quot;数字感&quot;，但需保持可控。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性维护</strong>：Power Grade 把创意决策与技术校正分离，使风格能跨项目复用而技术参数按素材调整。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"色调映射的概念框架\">色调映射的概念框架</h2><p>色调映射（Tone Mapping）是将场景的物理亮度范围映射到显示设备可再现范围的过程。在更广义的调色语境中，色调映射也指通过非线性传输函数塑造画面的明暗分布和色彩倾向，从而建立特定的视觉风格。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;色调映射的双重含义&quot;&#10;        TECH[&quot;技术色调映射\\n(HDR→SDR / 场景→显示)&quot;]&#10;        CREATIVE[&quot;创意色调映射\\n(风格化处理)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;技术层面&quot;&#10;        TECH --&gt; TM1[&quot;压缩动态范围&quot;]&#10;        TECH --&gt; TM2[&quot;保留细节与对比&quot;]&#10;        TECH --&gt; TM3[&quot;适配显示能力&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;创意层面&quot;&#10;        CREATIVE --&gt; CM1[&quot;建立明暗基调&quot;]&#10;        CREATIVE --&gt; CM2[&quot;定义色彩倾向&quot;]&#10;        CREATIVE --&gt; CM3[&quot;塑造情绪氛围&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"色调映射的双重含义\"\n        TECH[\"技术色调映射\\n(HDR→SDR / 场景→显示)\"]\n        CREATIVE[\"创意色调映射\\n(风格化处理)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"技术层面\"\n        TECH --&gt; TM1[\"压缩动态范围\"]\n        TECH --&gt; TM2[\"保留细节与对比\"]\n        TECH --&gt; TM3[\"适配显示能力\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"创意层面\"\n        CREATIVE --&gt; CM1[\"建立明暗基调\"]\n        CREATIVE --&gt; CM2[\"定义色彩倾向\"]\n        CREATIVE --&gt; CM3[\"塑造情绪氛围\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"全局-vs-局部色调映射\">全局 vs 局部色调映射</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>操作方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局 (Global)</td>\n<td>对所有像素统一变换</td>\n<td>简单高效</td>\n<td>局部对比度可能丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部 (Local)</td>\n<td>基于邻域自适应</td>\n<td>保留局部对比</td>\n<td>可能产生光晕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合 (Hybrid)</td>\n<td>全局+局部融合</td>\n<td>平衡效果</td>\n<td>计算复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>全局映射</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（单一函数作用于所有像素）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{全局映射}: L_{display} = f(L_{scene}) \\quad \\text{（单一函数作用于所有像素）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全局映射</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（单一函数作用于所有像素）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>局部映射</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（考虑邻域平均）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{局部映射}: L_{display}(x,y) = f(L_{scene}(x,y),\\ \\bar{L}_{local}(x,y)) \\quad \\text{（考虑邻域平均）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">局部映射</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0701em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（考虑邻域平均）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"经典色调映射算子\">经典色调映射算子</h2><h3 id=\"reinhard-映射\">Reinhard 映射</h3><p>Reinhard 色调映射是最经典的全局映射算子之一：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{out} = \\frac{L_{in}}{1 + L_{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个简单的公式具有优雅的特性：低亮度区域接近线性（保留暗部细节），高亮度区域渐进压缩到 1（防止过曝），中间调自然过渡。</p>\n<p>改进版本引入白点参数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{out} = \\frac{L_{in}(1 + L_{in}/L_{white}^2)}{1 + L_{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3271em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"aces-色调映射\">ACES 色调映射</h3><p>ACES（Academy Color Encoding System）的 RRT（Reference Rendering Transform）包含一个精心设计的 S 型色调映射曲线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ACES 版本</th>\n<th>色调映射特征</th>\n<th>已知问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ACES 1.x RRT</td>\n<td>高对比度、中灰提升</td>\n<td>红色/肤色偏移、暗部去饱和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ACES 2.0</td>\n<td>改进的平滑映射</td>\n<td>更一致的 SDR/HDR 表现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ACES 2.0 于 2024-2025 年正式发布，解决了 1.x 中极端颜色（特别是红色和火焰）的色相偏移问题，同时为 HDR 和 SDR 提供一致的创意外观。</p>\n<h3 id=\"filmlook-s-曲线\">FilmLook S 曲线</h3><p>电影胶片的光化学特性天然产生 S 型响应曲线，这一特征被数字调色模拟：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>胶片特征</th>\n<th>数字模拟参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>肩部（Shoulder）</td>\n<td>高光柔和滚降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>趾部（Toe）</td>\n<td>暗部柔和压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直线段（Straight）</td>\n<td>中间调线性响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色彩串扰</td>\n<td>RGB 通道间交叉影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D-min</td>\n<td>最小密度（暗部底色）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>S 曲线参数化</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>a</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>white_level</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{S 曲线参数化}: y = \\frac{(x/w)^a}{(x/w)^a + 1} \\times \\text{white\\_level}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">曲线参数化</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">white_level</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 控制对比度坡度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 控制白点位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"色彩风格化方法\">色彩风格化方法</h2><h3 id=\"split-toning-分离色调\">Split Toning（分离色调）</h3><p>Split Toning 为画面的暗部和亮部分别添加不同色彩：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Split Toning 原理&quot;&#10;        INPUT[原始画面] --&gt; SPLIT[亮度分离]&#10;        SPLIT --&gt; SHADOW[&quot;暗部: 添加色调A&quot;]&#10;        SPLIT --&gt; HIGHLIGHT[&quot;亮部: 添加色调B&quot;]&#10;        SHADOW --&gt; BLEND[混合]&#10;        HIGHLIGHT --&gt; BLEND&#10;        BLEND --&gt; OUTPUT[风格化输出]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Split Toning 原理\"\n        INPUT[原始画面] --&gt; SPLIT[亮度分离]\n        SPLIT --&gt; SHADOW[\"暗部: 添加色调A\"]\n        SPLIT --&gt; HIGHLIGHT[\"亮部: 添加色调B\"]\n        SHADOW --&gt; BLEND[混合]\n        HIGHLIGHT --&gt; BLEND\n        BLEND --&gt; OUTPUT[风格化输出]\n    end</pre><p>经典 Split Toning 组合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格名称</th>\n<th>暗部色调</th>\n<th>亮部色调</th>\n<th>情绪</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Teal &amp; Orange</td>\n<td>青色/蓝绿</td>\n<td>橙色/暖黄</td>\n<td>商业电影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝调</td>\n<td>深蓝</td>\n<td>淡蓝</td>\n<td>冷峻/科技</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暖复古</td>\n<td>深棕</td>\n<td>乳白/暖黄</td>\n<td>怀旧/温馨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品红冷调</td>\n<td>品红</td>\n<td>冰蓝</td>\n<td>霓虹/未来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绿色矩阵</td>\n<td>深绿</td>\n<td>浅绿</td>\n<td>黑客/数字</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Split Tone</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Output</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Split Tone}: \\text{Output} = (1-L) \\times C_{shadow} + L \\times C_{highlight}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Split Tone</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Output</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为像素亮度（0-1），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{shadow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{highlight}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为暗部和亮部目标色调。</p>\n<h3 id=\"色彩和声理论应用\">色彩和声理论应用</h3><p>基于色轮和谐理论进行风格化调色：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>和声模式</th>\n<th>色彩关系</th>\n<th>视觉效果</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>互补色</td>\n<td>180° 对角</td>\n<td>强对比、活跃</td>\n<td>商业片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类似色</td>\n<td>30-60° 相邻</td>\n<td>和谐、统一</td>\n<td>风景/氛围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角色</td>\n<td>120° 等分</td>\n<td>丰富但平衡</td>\n<td>动画/奇幻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分裂互补</td>\n<td>互补色两侧各30°</td>\n<td>对比但柔和</td>\n<td>人像/时尚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"去饱和与选择性着色\">去饱和与选择性着色</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局去饱和</td>\n<td>降低整体饱和度</td>\n<td>Saturation 滑块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留肤色去饱和</td>\n<td>仅保留肤色区域饱和度</td>\n<td>Qualifier + 外部节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单色保留 (Sin City)</td>\n<td>仅保留特定色相</td>\n<td>Hue vs Sat 曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉去饱和</td>\n<td>暗部低饱和、亮部高饱和</td>\n<td>Sat vs Luma 曲线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"电影质感模拟\">电影质感模拟</h2><h3 id=\"胶片颗粒-film-grain\">胶片颗粒（Film Grain）</h3><p>胶片颗粒为数字画面添加有机纹理，减少&quot;数字感&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>颗粒参数</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>推荐值（叙事电影）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强度 (Amount)</td>\n<td>颗粒明显度</td>\n<td>10-25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大小 (Size)</td>\n<td>颗粒尺寸</td>\n<td>1.0-2.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>柔和度 (Softness)</td>\n<td>颗粒锐度</td>\n<td>0.3-0.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亮度响应</td>\n<td>亮区/暗区分布</td>\n<td>暗部更多</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Grain 合成</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Output</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Input</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>Intensity</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Luminance</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Grain 合成}: \\text{Output} = \\text{Input} + G(x,y) \\times \\text{Intensity} \\times f(\\text{Luminance})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Grain </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合成</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Output</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Intensity</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Luminance</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"高光-bloom-与-halation\">高光 Bloom 与 Halation</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>物理来源</th>\n<th>数字模拟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bloom</td>\n<td>镜头内部散射</td>\n<td>高光模糊叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Halation</td>\n<td>胶片基层红光反射</td>\n<td>高光边缘红色溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flare</td>\n<td>镜头眩光</td>\n<td>方向性光晕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gate Weave</td>\n<td>胶片机械抖动</td>\n<td>画面微抖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些效果在 DaVinci Resolve 的 OpenFX 或 Fusion 页面中实现，为画面增添电影质感的同时保持可控性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风格一致性维护\">风格一致性维护</h2><h3 id=\"power-grade-与-style-库\">Power Grade 与 Style 库</h3><p>Power Grade 是 DaVinci Resolve 中保存完整节点树（包含所有参数）的机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管理方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Gallery Still</td>\n<td>单镜头参考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power Grade</td>\n<td>跨项目风格复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Group Grade</td>\n<td>同场景批量应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Timeline Grade</td>\n<td>时间线级统一处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>风格一致性</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Power Grade 标准化</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>素材一次校正质量</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{风格一致性} = f(\\text{Power Grade 标准化}) \\times g(\\text{素材一次校正质量})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">风格一致性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Power Grade </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">标准化</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">素材一次校正质量</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>建立个人风格库的核心：将创意决策与技术校正分离——技术校正因素材而异，但创意风格应跨项目一致复用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>色调映射兼具技术压缩与创意风格化两重职能。技术上它以全局或局部算子把高动态范围压缩到显示能力之内，Reinhard、ACES 与胶片 S 曲线是三种典型思路；创意上则通过 Split Toning、色彩和声、去饱和等手法建立画面的明暗基调和色彩倾向。胶片颗粒、Bloom、Halation 等效果进一步模拟电影质感，但强度必须可控，避免喧宾夺主。风格一致性依靠 Power Grade 与 Group Grade 机制来维护——把技术校正与创意决策分层管理，可以让同一套 Look 在不同素材、不同项目间稳定复用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"色调映射与风格化技术","id":"色调映射与风格化技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"色调映射的概念框架","id":"色调映射的概念框架"},{"level":3,"text":"全局 vs 局部色调映射","id":"全局-vs-局部色调映射"},{"level":2,"text":"经典色调映射算子","id":"经典色调映射算子"},{"level":3,"text":"Reinhard 映射","id":"reinhard-映射"},{"level":3,"text":"ACES 色调映射","id":"aces-色调映射"},{"level":3,"text":"FilmLook S 曲线","id":"filmlook-s-曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"色彩风格化方法","id":"色彩风格化方法"},{"level":3,"text":"Split Toning（分离色调）","id":"split-toning-分离色调"},{"level":3,"text":"色彩和声理论应用","id":"色彩和声理论应用"},{"level":3,"text":"去饱和与选择性着色","id":"去饱和与选择性着色"},{"level":2,"text":"电影质感模拟","id":"电影质感模拟"},{"level":3,"text":"胶片颗粒（Film Grain）","id":"胶片颗粒-film-grain"},{"level":3,"text":"高光 Bloom 与 Halation","id":"高光-bloom-与-halation"},{"level":2,"text":"风格一致性维护","id":"风格一致性维护"},{"level":3,"text":"Power Grade 与 Style 库","id":"power-grade-与-style-库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"LUT 原理与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/lut"},"next":{"title":"风格化处理与视觉叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/visual-narrative"}}